## Built to meet your security requirements
Developed and hosted in the EU on a qualified, high-security infrastructure.

::: cards
- Security | Hosted on a **qualified** infrastructure.
- Backups | Daily automatic backups to a second zone.
- Certification | **ISO 27001** certified.
:::

::: pills
- Sovereign
- Modular
- User-centered
- Measurable
:::

